#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:21
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Quloudの「ファイルアップロード」でMaterialとして登録する構造です。\\ "
"いずれもfccのCuの原始胞（1原子）のCIFファイルで、3辺の長さが立方晶の格子定数の :math:`1/\\sqrt{2}` "
"、辺のなす角が60°です。\\ ファイル名の数字が立方晶の格子定数（Å）です。"
msgstr ""
"Register these structures as Materials using \"File Upload\" in Quloud. "
"\\ Each CIF file contains a one-atom primitive cell of fcc Cu. All three "
"edges have length :math:`1/\\sqrt{2}` times the cubic lattice constant, "
"and the angles between them are 60°. \\ The number in each filename is "
"the cubic lattice constant in Å."

