#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:146
msgid "1. エネルギー曲線（SCF計算）"
msgstr "1. Energy Curve (SCF Calculations)"

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:148
msgid ""
"計算機能「自己無撞着電子状態計算（SCF）」で、構造ファイルごとにJobを作り、実行します。\\ "
"Quloudは、3辺が等しく角が60°のセルを、QEの入力で ``ibrav = 2`` （fcc）、 ``A`` = "
"立方晶の格子定数（Å）として書きます。\\ 3.64 Å・60 RyのJobの入力ファイル ``QuloudJob.scf.in`` "
"は、k点メッシュが24×24×24であることを除いて、 :doc:`../kpoints/reproduction` に示したものと同じです。\\"
" 1件の計算時間は、60 Ryで約20秒、120 Ryで約2.5分です。"
msgstr ""
"Use \"Single-Point SCF\" (a self-consistent electronic structure "
"calculation) to create and run a Job for each structure file. \\ For a "
"cell with three equal edges and angles of 60°, Quloud writes ``ibrav = "
"2`` (fcc) and sets ``A`` to the cubic lattice constant in Å in the QE "
"input. \\ The input file ``QuloudJob.scf.in`` for the 3.64 Å Job at 60 Ry"
" matches the one in :doc:`../kpoints/reproduction` except that it uses a "
"24×24×24 k-point mesh. \\ Each calculation took about 20 seconds at 60 Ry"
" and about 2.5 minutes at 120 Ry."

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:154
msgid "2. 格子定数最適化（vc-relax）"
msgstr "2. Lattice Constant Optimization (vc-relax)"

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:156
msgid "計算機能「格子定数最適化」で、共通の設定に加えて次の項目を設定します。"
msgstr ""
"To optimize the lattice constant, select \"Lattice Optimization\" and set"
" the following fields in addition to the common settings."

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:165
msgid "応力の収束閾値"
msgstr "Stress Convergence Threshold"

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:166
msgid "0.01 GPa"
msgstr "0.01 GPa"

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:167
msgid "**変更** （既定値は0.5 GPa）"
msgstr "**Changed** (default: 0.5 GPa)"

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:168
msgid "目標圧力"
msgstr "Target Pressure"

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:169
msgid "0 GPa"
msgstr "0 GPa"

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:171
msgid "最適化最大ステップ数"
msgstr "Max Optimization Steps"

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:172
msgid "100"
msgstr "100"

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:174
msgid "力の収束閾値"
msgstr "Force Convergence Threshold"

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:175
msgid "0.05 eV/Å"
msgstr "0.05 eV/Å"

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:178
msgid ""
"**応力の収束閾値の既定値0.5 GPa（5 kbar）は、この記事の目的には粗すぎます。** 圧力1 kbarは格子定数の約0.001 "
"Åに相当するので、5 kbarでは0.005 Å程度の誤差が残りえます。\\ "
"1原子のfccの原始胞では、対称性により原子に力ははたらかないので、力の収束閾値は結果に影響しません。"
msgstr ""
"**The default \"Stress Convergence Threshold\" of 0.5 GPa (5 kbar) is too"
" coarse for this example.** A pressure difference of 1 kbar corresponds "
"to about 0.001 Å in the lattice constant, so a threshold of 5 kbar can "
"leave an error of about 0.005 Å. \\ In the one-atom fcc primitive cell, "
"symmetry gives zero force on the atom, so the force convergence threshold"
" does not affect the result."

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:181
msgid "3.64 Å・60 RyのJobの入力ファイルは次のようになります。"
msgstr "The input file for the Job at 3.64 Å and 60 Ry is as follows."

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:183
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"&control\n"
" calculation = 'vc-relax'\n"
" prefix = 'QuloudJob'\n"
" tstress = .true.\n"
" tprnfor = .true.\n"
" pseudo_dir = './'\n"
" outdir = './work'\n"
" verbosity = 'high'\n"
" nstep = 100\n"
" forc_conv_thr = 0.00194463\n"
"/\n"
"&system\n"
" nat = 1\n"
" ntyp = 1\n"
" ibrav = 2\n"
