#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:227
msgid ""
"QEの ``press_conv_thr`` の単位はkbarなので、0.01 GPaは ``0.1000`` と書かれます。\\ 出力ファイル "
"``QuloudJob.scf.out`` の最後の ``Begin final coordinates`` から ``End final "
"coordinates`` の間に最適化後のセルが、その後の ``The G-vectors are recalculated for the "
"final unit cell`` に続くSCF計算の ``P=`` に、平面波を選び直したときの圧力が書かれます。\\ 1件の計算時間は、60 "
"Ryで約2〜7分、120 Ryで約8分です。"
msgstr ""
"QE specifies ``press_conv_thr`` in kbar, so 0.01 GPa is written as "
"``0.1000``. \\ In the output file ``QuloudJob.scf.out``, the optimized "
"cell is between the last ``Begin final coordinates`` and ``End final "
"coordinates`` markers. After ``The G-vectors are recalculated for the "
"final unit cell``, the SCF calculation reports the pressure for the newly"
" selected plane waves as ``P=``. \\ Each calculation took about 2–7 "
"minutes at 60 Ry and about 8 minutes at 120 Ry."

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:231
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"記事のやり直しの計算（3.6287 Åから）は、3.56 Åから始めたJobの最適化後の格子定数（ ``Begin final "
"coordinates`` の後の ``CELL_PARAMETERS`` から求めた値）で原始胞のCIFを作り、同じ設定で実行したものです。\\"
" 立方晶の格子定数 :math:`a` は、 ``CELL_PARAMETERS (alat= ...)`` の ``alat`` "
"（bohr）と、1行目の最初の成分 :math:`x` から :math:`a = "
"2|x|\\times\\mathrm{alat}\\times0.529177` Åで求まります。"
msgstr ""
"For the restart in the article (from 3.6287 Å), we created a primitive-"
"cell CIF using the optimized lattice constant of the Job started at 3.56 "
"Å, obtained from ``Begin final coordinates`` and the subsequent "
"``CELL_PARAMETERS``, and ran it with the same settings. \\ The cubic "
"lattice constant :math:`a` follows from the ``CELL_PARAMETERS (alat= "
"...)`` value of ``alat`` in bohr and the first component :math:`x` of the"
" first row as :math:`a = 2|x|\\times\\mathrm{alat}\\times0.529177` Å."

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:235
msgid "3. 出力のダウンロードと解析"
msgstr "3. Downloading and Analyzing the Output"

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:237
msgid ""
"各Jobの詳細画面の「ファイル」で「出力ファイル」に切り替え、「一括ダウンロード」でZIPを取得します。\\ "
"ダウンロードしたZIPを1つのフォルダ（例えば ``downloads`` ）に集め、そのフォルダを指定して解析スクリプトを実行します。"
msgstr ""
"On each Job's details page, open \"Files\", switch to \"Output Files\", "
"and use \"Batch Download\" to get the ZIP archive. \\ Put the downloaded "
"ZIP archives in one folder, such as ``downloads``, and pass that folder "
"to the analysis script."

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:240
msgid "python analyze_cu_lattice.py downloads"
msgstr "python analyze_cu_lattice.py downloads"

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:244
msgid ""
"スクリプトは、フォルダの中のZIPを1つずつ開き、pw.xの出力（ ``Program PWSCF`` "
"を含むファイル）と、同じフォルダにある入力のコピー（ ``K_POINTS`` を含むファイル）から、次の内容を読み取ってJobを判定します。"
msgstr ""
"The script opens each ZIP archive in the folder. To identify the Job, it "
"reads the following information from the pw.x output (the file containing"
" ``Program PWSCF``) and the copy of the input in the same folder (the "
"file containing ``K_POINTS``)."

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:246
msgid "計算の種類（入力の ``calculation`` が ``'scf'`` か ``'vc-relax'`` か）"
msgstr ""
"Calculation type (whether ``calculation`` in the input is ``'scf'`` or "
"``'vc-relax'``)"

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:247
msgid ""
"格子定数（出力の ``lattice parameter (alat)`` 。 ``ibrav = 2`` の場合は立方晶の格子定数。 ``vc-"
"relax`` では開始時の値）"
msgstr ""
"Lattice constant (``lattice parameter (alat)`` in the output, which is "
"the cubic lattice constant for ``ibrav = 2`` and the starting value for "
"``vc-relax``)"

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:248
msgid "カットオフエネルギー（出力の ``kinetic-energy cutoff`` ）"
msgstr "Cutoff energy (``kinetic-energy cutoff`` in the output)"

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:250
msgid ""
"ZIPの名前やファイル名は判定に使わないので、ダウンロードしたままの名前で構いません。\\ 展開したフォルダを指定することもできます。\\ "
"同じ条件のJobが複数あるときは、最初の1つだけを使います。\\ 判定の結果を最初に表示し、続いて記事中の数値を表示して、図を "
"``figures`` フォルダに書き出します（ ``--figures`` で変更できます）。\\ "
"一部の計算だけを行った場合は、そのJobから求められる数値と図だけを出力します。"
msgstr ""
"The script does not use ZIP names or filenames to identify Jobs, so you "
"can keep the downloaded names. \\ You can also pass a folder of extracted"
" files. \\ If there are multiple Jobs with the same conditions, the "
"script uses only the first one. \\ It first reports the Jobs it "
"identified, then prints the numerical results and writes the figures to "
"the ``figures`` folder, which you can change with ``--figures``. \\ If "
"you run only some of the calculations, the script outputs only the values"
" and figures that those Jobs provide."

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:256
msgid "記事の数値と図は、上の「記事の計算の出力」のZIPを1つのフォルダに集めて、同じように実行すると得られます。"
msgstr ""
"To reproduce the numerical results and figures in the article, put the "
"ZIP archives from \"Output from the Calculations in This Article\" above "
"in one folder and run the script in the same way."

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:258
msgid "python analyze_cu_lattice.py data"
msgstr "python analyze_cu_lattice.py data"

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:262
msgid ""
"Jobの数を減らして試す場合は、例えば60 Ryのエネルギー曲線のうち3.58〜3.70 Åの7点と、3.64 Åからの ``vc-relax``"
" "
"をQuloudで計算し、配布した出力の同じ条件の値と全エネルギー・圧力が一致することを確かめてから、残りは配布した出力で解析する、という進め方ができます。\\"
" 7点でも、Birch–Murnaghanの式の格子定数は13点の場合と同じ3.6303 Åになります（ :numref:`tab-cl-eos`"
" ）。"
msgstr ""
"If you want to try fewer Jobs, one option is to run the 7 points from "
"3.58 to 3.70 Å in the 60 Ry energy curve and the ``vc-relax`` run from "
"3.64 Å in Quloud. You can then confirm that the total energies and "
"pressures match the supplied outputs for the same conditions before using"
" the supplied outputs for the remaining calculations in the analysis. \\ "
"The Birch–Murnaghan fit gives 3.6303 Å with 7 points, the same lattice "
"constant as with 13 points (:numref:`tab-cl-eos`)."

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:266
msgid "計算と数値を扱う上での注意"
msgstr "Notes on Calculations and Numerical Results"

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:268
msgid ""
"**SCFの収束閾値と圧力。** 圧力（応力）は全エネルギーより収束が遅く、SCF収束閾値を1e-9 "
"Ryにすると、Cuの圧力が計算の設定によって約1 kbarばらつきます（ :doc:`../kpoints/reproduction` "
"）。圧力を比べる計算では、閾値を1e-12 Ryにしてください。"
msgstr ""
"**SCF convergence threshold and pressure.** Pressure (stress) converges "
"more slowly than total energy. At an SCF convergence threshold of 1e-9 "
"Ry, the pressure for Cu varies by about 1 kbar with the calculation "
"settings (see :doc:`../kpoints/reproduction`). Use 1e-12 Ry for "
"calculations that compare pressures."

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:269
msgid ""
"**QuloudのバージョンとSCFの入力。** QuloudのVer.7.0.2より前のバージョンでは、fccの原始胞を ``ibrav = "
"5`` （菱面体晶）として書きます。全エネルギーは同じですが、解析スクリプトは ``ibrav = 2`` の出力だけを読みます。"
msgstr ""
"**Quloud version and SCF input.** Versions before Quloud Ver.7.0.2 write "
"the fcc primitive cell as ``ibrav = 5`` (rhombohedral). The total energy "
"is the same, but the analysis script reads only output for ``ibrav = 2``."

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:270
msgid "**エネルギーの単位。** 全エネルギーはRy、体積弾性率は1 Ry/Å\\ :sup:`3` = 2179.87 GPaで換算しています。"
msgstr ""
"**Energy units.** The total energy is in Ry, and we convert the bulk "
"modulus using 1 Ry/Å\\ :sup:`3` = 2179.87 GPa."

#: ../../cu_lattice/reproduction.rst:271
msgid ""
"**計算時間。** 記事の時間は、WSL2のMPI 4並列で、QEの出力の最後の ``PWSCF`` "
"の行の経過時間（WALL）です。Quloudで実行すると、選んだインスタンスによって変わります。"
msgstr ""
"**Calculation times.** The article reports elapsed times (WALL) from the "
"final ``PWSCF`` line of the QE output for runs on WSL2 with 4 MPI "
"processes. In Quloud, the timing depends on the instance you select."

